---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Projects" description="Side projects and open-source experiments by Eirik Breen.">
  <section class="page projects-page">
    <header class="intro">
      <p class="kicker">Built after hours</p>
      <h1>Small tools. Real reasons.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Things I’m building outside client work—usually because a workflow annoyed me, a new platform looked
        interesting, or I wanted to see how far an idea could go.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="project-notes">
      <article class="project" aria-labelledby="project-cloudmount">
        <header>
          <div class="project-meta">
            <span>01 / 02</span>
            <span>in progress</span>
          </div>
          <p class="section-label">Native macOS utility</p>
          <h2 id="project-cloudmount">CloudMount</h2>
        </header>

        <p class="project-description">
          A macOS menu bar app that mounts Backblaze B2 buckets as native Finder volumes. It uses Apple’s FSKit
          framework, so buckets appear as ordinary folders—no FUSE and no kernel extensions. Currently macOS 26+.
        </p>

        <ul class="technologies" aria-label="CloudMount technologies">
          <li>swift</li>
          <li>fskit</li>
          <li>macos</li>
          <li>backblaze-b2</li>
        </ul>

        <a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/ebreen/cloudmount" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          View repository
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="project" aria-labelledby="project-solana-agent-toolkit">
        <header>
          <div class="project-meta">
            <span>02 / 02</span>
            <span>open source</span>
          </div>
          <p class="section-label">Tools for agents</p>
          <h2 id="project-solana-agent-toolkit">Solana Agent Toolkit</h2>
        </header>

        <p class="project-description">
          A set of 27 JavaScript tools for Solana development: wallet operations, token management, Jupiter swaps,
          yield tracking, NFT minting, and DCA bots. Designed for AI agents to call programmatically.
        </p>

        <ul class="technologies" aria-label="Solana Agent Toolkit technologies">
          <li>javascript</li>
          <li>solana</li>
          <li>agents</li>
          <li>web3</li>
        </ul>

        <a
          class="project-link"
          href="https://github.com/ebreen/solana-agent-toolkit"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          View repository
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <aside class="github-note">
      <p>There are more experiments—and considerably more half-finished branches—over on GitHub.</p>
      <a href="https://github.com/ebreen" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open the workbench</a>
    </aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .projects-page {
    width: min(100%, 42rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 12vw, 10rem);
  }

  .intro {
    margin-bottom: clamp(8rem, 19vw, 13rem);
  }

  .kicker,
  .section-label,
  .project-meta,
  .technologies {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .kicker,
  .section-label {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 8ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 11vw, 7rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    line-height: 0.9;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 35rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.2vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .project {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5rem) clamp(7rem, 17vw, 11rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .project-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 7rem);
  }

  .project-meta span:last-child {
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .project h2 {
    max-width: 11ch;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(3.3rem, 9vw, 5.7rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 0.94;
  }

  .project-description {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .technologies {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    text-transform: lowercase;
  }

  .technologies li:not(:last-child)::after {
    margin-right: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--faint);
    content: ",";
  }

  .project-link,
  .github-note a {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    text-decoration-line: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.28em;
  }

  .project-link:hover,
  .github-note a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .github-note {
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .github-note p {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 4.5vw, 2.25rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  @media (max-width: 36rem) {
    .projects-page {
      padding-block: 4rem 7rem;
    }

    .project-meta {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
